Gi4KQGDgNXrxzY_PBsOLPNr1_4ui1Sw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsSl_Z7kHTKSQF7L2ej8TuRxaZTAzwExjQWwH2GWAczDQ&oe=69A584A2"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.08.47.png", "id": "1426309168884035", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619646_1426309172217368_1019297969091737075_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uoamSJ_IKM8Q7kNvwF7bjot&_nc_oc=Adl3bBJ3lKWyOEUdUYH5-wKYKylkSuIqTaeFNFkFXQaz-1XuEfTtSz0u6tcDqBMIxlc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuF4mFAIBmCXA2e7k5XzHuLWZO_wXFzWDHx2LDpAc6eVQ&oe=69A57291"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.09.12.png", "id": "1791231008391357", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620432_1791231011724690_7646563548256713933_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6kRhkimXxH4Q7kNvwGB026x&_nc_oc=AdmOmFD3RgHu5Lxa_Wt9SUlywP89ZUZbHvMhTvyGV1qQ6M2txvXIcRjgWPQQ15mnwbI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuMHMKKPz3zUi65MK-QujXDGoOaGKAW6jQt1jWz-j7fdg&oe=69A59D21"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.09.41.png", "id": "25923127443961648", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618264_25923127447294981_5221699009642254234_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kK1h6abqqKkQ7kNvwHu1WTo&_nc_oc=AdlVghrz4Nk0tOf62lWaU4H4BSHIRnC0ZN7WZBFNDgIDUj2242ECDnHW9uxBkdC0GyY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftQZ2zXQ6xUW0sKqFH4m0SZ4KZIkPqYtmb7ddSEPq-tfw&oe=69A58970"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.10.18.png", "id": "1374499653759686", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618274_1374499657093019_1388091325729183700_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PdK_E9-sYiMQ7kNvwEWET1D&_nc_oc=AdmZflesT6Toe4DgXeAAtYQL0PRO833oMOrGVqlNdhOJjTH6M-7ZqVANZcuWyvABf9w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv6nIdRoWlNqBI5ZEoMwDj3nF4tOWP8-TN14dNsqY-A6w&oe=69A57DEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "S-Calculator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "A stylish, simple, and easy-to-use calculator with a hidden feature\n\nA stylish calculator app with a design based on black.\nWe have simply gathered the functions needed for daily calculations, pursuing true ease of use.\n\n[Main Features]\n\u30fbBasic Functions: Arithmetic operations (+, -, \u00d7, \u00f7), percentage calculations, and sign switching (+/-).\n\u30fbUsability: Equipped with haptic feedback (vibration) when buttons are pressed.\n\u30fbDesign: Uses an eye-friendly dark mode and a highly readable programming font.\n\u30fbPrecision: Supports input of up to 15 digits, designed to minimize calculation errors.\n\n[Hidden Feature]\nTired of calculating? How about a little break?\nIf you tap the \"=\" button 5 times rapidly while in the initial state (when \"0\" is displayed), a hidden game mode will launch.\nPlease enjoy a simple yet engrossing side-scrolling action game.\n(Game Controls: Jump with \"0\", Return to calculator with \"AC\")\n\nMaking daily calculations a little more fun.\nWe hope you download and make use of it.", "short_description": "A stylish calculator designed in black. It distills daily functions into simplicity, created with a focus on pure usability."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://lubyte.net/s-dentaku-privacy-policy-and-terms-of-service/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://lubyte.net/s-dentaku-privacy-policy-and-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Lubyte", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://lubyte.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NO